t matchmaking or host private games with friends.\n{1419364789091316}\n\ud83e\udd4f **Attack With Skill** \u2013 Curve forehands, smash power shots, and unleash corkscrew spins.\n{1175152467694364}\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f **Defend Your Goal** \u2013 Block shots like a soccer goalie and sharpen your reflexes every time you play.\n\n\ud83c\udfcb\ufe0f **Fun VR Workout** \u2013 Full-body action that keeps you moving. It\u2019s a fitness experience that doesn\u2019t feel like one.\n\n\ud83d\ude80 **Free to Play, More to Come** \u2013 Cosmetics, leaderboards, and new modes are on the way.\n\n\ud83d\udce3 **Join the Community** \u2013 Connect with players, find matches, and shape the future of DISC: disc.asics.com", "short_description": "3D Air Hockey \u2013 Made for VR!\n\nWelcome to DISC \u2013 a new sport created by ASICS."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://disc.asics.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "ASICS Ventures Corporation", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://disc.asics.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "2776542286000603"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "SINGLE_USER"], "id": "9796932147025972"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1407862257128657"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1407862257128657"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOf